{
  "scope": "Release Bash restart caches, snapshots, argument vectors, unwind payloads, expansion buffers and discarded trap strings. Dispose rejected arithmetic-for trees, failed arithmetic assignment/increment strings, temporary word lists, reader commands abandoned during exec restart and replaced completion strings. Track owned standard remaps and redirection backups, forget normal backup closes, and finalize abandoned descriptors at normal exit.",
